      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds nice in theory but it doesn't change anything. the silence is just... heavy. it feels like i'm just going through the motions while the person who actually made life worth living is just gone. sometimes i just sit there staring at the wall wondering why i'm even trying to keep going when everything that mattered is already over.",
